      <li>Click <strong>Project</strong> &gt; <strong>Manage Projects</strong>.</li>
      <li>Select the project.</li>
      <li>In the <strong>Default Root Map</strong> field, enter <code>audacity-guide.ditamap</code>.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>The project stores the setting in <code>.dogsbay/config.xml</code> as <code>&lt;default-root-map&gt;audacity-guide.ditamap&lt;/default-root-map&gt;</code>. The health check uses this map to decide which topics belong to the publication.</p>
      <p>Validate the map in the editor with <strong>XML</strong> &gt; <strong>Validate</strong>, or run this command from the project root:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"dogsbay-xml validate audacity-guide.ditamap"} lang="bash" />
